What:		/proc/sentry_reporter/ub_mem_fault_with_kill
Date:		February 2025
Contact:	Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. <sxt1001@huawei.com>
Description:
		Control whether to kill related processes when UB memory faults occur.

		Write Values:
			"on"  - Enable process termination on memory faults
			"off" - Disable process termination on memory faults

		Read Values:
			"on" or "off" - Current process termination policy status

		Examples:
			# Enable process termination on memory faults
			echo "on" > /proc/sentry_reporter/ub_mem_fault_with_kill

			# Disable process termination on memory faults
			echo "off" > /proc/sentry_reporter/ub_mem_fault_with_kill

			# Check current status
			cat /proc/sentry_reporter/ub_mem_fault_with_kill
			on

		Function Details:
		- Terminates related processes for specific types of UB memory errors
		- Triggers memory_failure mechanism in NUMA mode
		- Process termination is enabled by default